OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mix of
OL,6,Fclear spells and cloudy periods
OL,7,Ftonight, some light rain developing
OL,8,Facross the southeastern portion of the
OL,9,Fregions slowly moves northwest. Light
OL,10,Feasterly breeze, but feeling cool with
OL,11,Ftemperatures slightly below average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FCloudy to start with patchy
OL,14,Flight rain. Cloud breaking with some
OL,15,Freasonable bright spells developing
OL,16,Facross western parts. Light winds with
OL,17,Ftemperatures slightly below average.
OL,18,FMist and fog developing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
