OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure continues to dominate,
OL,7,Fhowever, cloud cover likely to break
OL,8,Fup allowing overnight mist and fog to
OL,9,Fdevelop, which will then clear slowly.
OL,10,FTemperatures remain slightly below
OL,11,Faverage.
